=== MATERIAL Scrab_bones
Fossilized bone
Fossilized bone is not easy to come by. But the result is worth the effort!

=== MATERIAL Silicon
Flint
A decent material for stone weapons.

=== MATERIAL Silk_Blue
Silk
Silk is the most expensive fabric, valued not only for its appearance but also for its durability.

=== MATERIAL Silk_Red
Wool
Wool fabric is strong and even absorbs the force of blows (though not well).

=== MATERIAL Steel
Steel
Plain steel.

=== MATERIAL Tanned_Thin
Twarda skóra
Z twardej skóry robi siê najlepsze pancerze skórzane.

=== MATERIAL Thick
Thick leather
A popular material for leather armor.

=== MATERIAL Thin
Thin leather
Too flimsy a material to make leather armor out of. Unless there is no better one at hand.

=== MATERIAL Tiger_Hide
Tiger skin
Tiger skin is used to make the most beautiful and very durable armor.

=== MATERIAL Tiger_Hide_White
Snow tiger skin
Snow tiger skin is beautiful, durable, reliable.... and expensive!

=== MATERIAL Troll_Black
Raw black troll skin
Troll scales are used to make very strong leather armor.

=== MATERIAL Troll_Blue
Blue Troll's rawhide
Troll scales are used to make very strong leather armor.

=== MATERIAL Troll_Green
Raw green troll skin
Troll scales are used to make very strong leather armor.

=== MATERIAL Wool
Flax
Linen is used to make the cheapest fabrics, of the lowest quality. Only very poor people wear such clothes.

